<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:itunes="http://www.itunes.com/dtds/podcast-1.0.dtd" version="2.0"><channel><title>云听 - 中国相声榜</title><link>https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/sanji/detail.html?columnId=15682090498666</link><atom:link href="http://rss.wudifeixue.com/radio/album/15682090498666" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>相声起源于华北地区的民间说唱曲艺，在明朝即已盛行。经清朝时期的发展直至民国初年，逐渐从一个人摹拟口技发展成为单口笑话。一种类型的单口相声，后来逐步发展为多种类型的单口相声、对口相声、群口相声，综合为一体。 - Made with love by RSSHub(https://github.com/DIYgod/RSSHub)</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>i@diygod.me (DIYgod)</webMaster><itunes:author>相声小品频道</itunes:author><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><language>en</language><image><url>https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg</url><title>云听 - 中国相声榜</title><link>https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/sanji/detail.html?columnId=15682090498666</link></image><lastBuildDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2026 00:37:10 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>相声里的“情感故事”</title><description>&lt;p&gt;韩蕾腾飞相声《爱情保卫战》&amp;nbsp;，董健春李丁相声《男朋友女朋友》，杜帅曾敏相声《同在屋檐下》，张番刘铨淼相声《天下球迷》。&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;audio controls=&quot;controls&quot;&gt;&lt;source src=&quot;https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F1590655867fba984c33d1b4bd54d5c62491aae7136h.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mp3&quot;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt; </description><link>https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F1590655867fba984c33d1b4bd54d5c62491aae7136h.mp3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">604487</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 08:56:37 GMT</pubDate><author>相声小品频道</author><itunes:image href="https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg"></itunes:image><enclosure url="https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F1590655867fba984c33d1b4bd54d5c62491aae7136h.mp3" length="17392660" type="audio/mp3"></enclosure><itunes:duration>0:48:14</itunes:duration></item><item><title>相声里的北京故事</title><description>&lt;p&gt;陈溯、王自健和说相声《我是北京人》；孟凡贵相声《北京轶事》；李寅飞叶蓬和说相声《北京话与普通话》；方清平相声《我的家在北京》。&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;audio controls=&quot;controls&quot;&gt;&lt;source src=&quot;https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906558279a3d93decd0af52b38c745ce5781b5cfh.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mp3&quot;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt; </description><link>https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906558279a3d93decd0af52b38c745ce5781b5cfh.mp3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">604488</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 08:54:52 GMT</pubDate><author>相声小品频道</author><itunes:image href="https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg"></itunes:image><enclosure url="https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906558279a3d93decd0af52b38c745ce5781b5cfh.mp3" length="16971670" type="audio/mp3"></enclosure><itunes:duration>0:47:18</itunes:duration></item><item><title>相声里的吃货故事</title><description>&lt;p&gt;高英培范振合说相声《论吃》，刘宝瑞郭全宝合说相声《吃饭我掏钱》，王玥波张永久《吃月饼》，马三立相声《吃饺子》。&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;audio controls=&quot;controls&quot;&gt;&lt;source src=&quot;https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906557852bb52153f447f5441081a02603129cdah.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mp3&quot;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt; </description><link>https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906557852bb52153f447f5441081a02603129cdah.mp3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">604489</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 08:53:50 GMT</pubDate><author>相声小品频道</author><itunes:image href="https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg"></itunes:image><enclosure url="https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906557852bb52153f447f5441081a02603129cdah.mp3" length="16918851" type="audio/mp3"></enclosure><itunes:duration>0:47:09</itunes:duration></item><item><title>相声里的语言研究</title><description>&lt;p&gt;吉祥、如意表演相声《弦外之音》，王声、吕纳超表演相声《语言的规律》，陈印泉、汉洪臻表演相声《学人物》,董健春、叶鹏表演相声《杂谈北京话》。&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;audio controls=&quot;controls&quot;&gt;&lt;source src=&quot;https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F1590655735b2e5498a1762b6f400a4d47e4514b654h.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mp3&quot;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt; </description><link>https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F1590655735b2e5498a1762b6f400a4d47e4514b654h.mp3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">604490</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 08:53:11 GMT</pubDate><author>相声小品频道</author><itunes:image href="https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg"></itunes:image><enclosure url="https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F1590655735b2e5498a1762b6f400a4d47e4514b654h.mp3" length="16580617" type="audio/mp3"></enclosure><itunes:duration>0:45:59</itunes:duration></item><item><title>说说“我”的故事</title><description>&lt;p&gt;王凯吴迪相声《我是文学家》；李云飞叶鹏相声《我爱世界杯》；王铮鑫王迎相声《我是有钱人》；贾旭明张霄相声《我爱记歌词》。&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;audio controls=&quot;controls&quot;&gt;&lt;source src=&quot;https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906557079b78120845ae146b4da924703e98f744h.mp3&quot; type=&quot;audio/mp3&quot;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt; </description><link>https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906557079b78120845ae146b4da924703e98f744h.mp3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">604502</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2020 08:52:17 GMT</pubDate><author>相声小品频道</author><itunes:image href="https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg"></itunes:image><enclosure url="https://ytmedia.radio.cn/CCYT%2F2020%2F05%2F28%2F15906557079b78120845ae146b4da924703e98f744h.mp3" length="16465104" type="audio/mp3"></enclosure><itunes:duration>0:45:40</itunes:duration></item><item><title>训徒</title><description>&lt;p&gt;天津的曲艺人才众多，天津的曲艺氛围比北京的曲艺氛围要弄浓很多，训教生徒，“以骂风骂语为训徒，以种菜种蔬为作务。”“训徒名门示高爽，枨臬中实皆轮囷。”&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;audio controls=&quot;controls&quot;&gt;&lt;source src=&quot;http://ytdem.radio.cn/sy/in/album/15682090498666/604501_2468ab68cf662860c263051c7f9cd9e2_h.m4a&quot; type=&quot;audio/m4a&quot;&gt;&lt;/audio&gt; </description><link>http://ytdem.radio.cn/sy/in/album/15682090498666/604501_2468ab68cf662860c263051c7f9cd9e2_h.m4a</link><guid isPermaLink="false">604501</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Sep 2019 08:29:08 GMT</pubDate><author>相声小品频道</author><itunes:image href="https://www.radio.cn/pc-portal/image/icon_32.jpg"></itune